  "rating": "5",
  "item_short_desc": "<p>Stay warm and prepared with our Concealed Carry Soft Shell Jacket. The discrete carry jacket features a waterproof 100% polyester outer shell that&rsquo;ll keep you and your EDC essentials dry. As part of Rothco&rsquo;s rugged Soft Shell outerwear series, the high-performance jacket shields you from cold and wet weather. The Soft Shell waterproof 3-layer fabric system deflects wind, retains heat, and releases moisture. Whether you are on-duty or out traveling, stay prepared with this tactical cold weather jacket.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "8773",
  "description": "<p>Stay warm and prepared with our Concealed Carry Soft Shell Jacket. The discrete carry jacket features a waterproof 100% polyester outer shell that&rsquo;ll keep you and your EDC essentials dry. As part of Rothco&rsquo;s rugged Soft Shell outerwear series, the high-performance jacket shields you from cold and wet weather. The Soft Shell waterproof 3-layer fabric system deflects wind, retains heat, and releases moisture. Whether you are on-duty or out traveling, stay prepared with this tactical cold weather jacket. CCW Design: Rothco&rsquo;s ambidextrous concealed carry pocket system features dual built-in padded pockets designed to safely and discretely holster firearms and personal accessories. In addition, each side features 2 internal mag pouches. Tactical Pockets: The military-styled discrete carry jacket comes equipped with a variety of pockets, including 2 zipper shoulder pockets, 2 zipper chest pockets, 1 back pocket, and 1 arm pocket for storing your CCW gear and tactical essentials. Tackle the Cold: Along with keeping your body warm and comfortable in a variety of environments, the CCW jacket&rsquo;s fleece liner is soft and breathable, giving you the freedom to move comfortably, no matter the location. This tactical concealed carry jacket is perfect for military personnel, public safety, outdoor enthusiasts, and more. Protection from the Elements: These CCW winter coats feature a removable stowaway hood that conveniently stores inside the collar, and is easily accessible when needed. The adjustable elastic wrist cuffs and drawstring waist help block the wind and cold weather while retaining your body temperature. Utility at the Forefront: The front two-way zipper allows you to open the windbreaker jacket from both the top and bottom for quick and easy access to your gear. The underarm ventilation zippers ensure optimal comfort by allowing air circulation. In addition, the 2 shoulder loop fields allow you to easily wear patches.</p>",
